            "line": 345,
            "text": "theorem monomial_rate {l : Filter SpaceTime} {h lo hi : ℝ}\n    (hh : 0 < h) (hh1 : h < 1 / 2) (A : PhysicalApproach l h lo hi)\n    {f : Inner → ℝ} (hf : ContDiff ℝ ∞ f) (b : ℝ) (m : ℕ) :\n    FiniteJetRate l (PhysicalWaveSum.physicalQ h) (cartesianMonomial h b f) m (b - m)"
